# LF, pinned. Same reason engine-rig and theory-compiler pin it: this track's
# artefacts are byte-compared -- the ledger is canonical JSON with `\n`
# terminators by LEDGER_FORMAT.md §1, the generated forms are byte-stable, and
# the book snapshots are diffed against each other to build the concept-birth
# timeline. A `core.autocrlf` that rewrites them turns every one of those
# comparisons into a false negative.
* text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jsonl text eol=lf
